      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 163,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "خلو منصب المدير",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "d2ad4e454dfdcd80b409e312759caa79db8f9e05a71ccf16a4fac0b36180a031",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "da7d6d69aa30fa1ec45f8e5f943e4ebf15667a2d6fb32f31ebce1cc682ef5313",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "有限责任公司只有一名经理的，在其职位空缺时，合伙人应当自知悉之日起（十五）日内为公司任命新经理；公司审计师（如有）或任何合伙人有权召集合伙人大会开会，以为公司任命新经理。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "3e1ca18eb65fdf8048174e188b516e4b2ad4037d14ad4a8922672867459de955",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 167,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "القوائم المالية وتقرير عن نشاط الشركة",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "b0ccd8270ba2cf915c19f394a92de02c04f8e20443a1188f6731115bd57ebc73",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "c6c4a27d09a96229437374adacf52288b96f8e76f5cd258bd7266733469addda",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "公司经理应当就每一会计年度编制公司的财务报表、关于已结束会计年度公司活动和财务状况的报告，以及关于利润分配（如有）的建议。经理应当在为合伙人大会年度会议确定的日期之前至少（四十五）日，将该等文件提供给审计师（如有）。\n公司经理应当在为合伙人大会年度会议确定的日期之前至少（二十一）日，以现代技术手段或公司设立合同规定的任何其他方式，向合伙人提供公司的财务报表、关于其活动的报告，以及审计师报告（如有）；经理还应当依照实施条例的规定存放该等文件。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "fa218268bff698a5fe488b721322950f1515a71015d61712254db859e88ee7a4",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 168,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "جدول أعمال الجمعية العامة للشركاء",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "291344f6e52a96260fbd7b3b90b00e12d9f768f5f489c8b3d44d3bff3b128d6c",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "fb55684fdabb86f324d44521521bd01cafc6050da3d2df05ee842d4a30be5bb1",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "合伙人大会年度会议的议程应当包括下列各项：\n（一）查阅经理关于已结束会计年度公司活动和财务状况的报告。\n（二）查阅并讨论已结束会计年度的财务报表。\n（三）讨论审计师关于已结束会计年度的报告（如有），并就其作出决定。\n（四）就经理关于利润分配（如有）的建议作出决定。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "bc038f1091b6a5470be91b9e66081b409b569a4098a3ae9396829db9f245fa33",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 169,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "المسائل المدرجة في جدول الأعمال",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "9263d638c1d9f550a17719e52f5fb5bfc42bd7021db1a1a31687c6294451d496",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "d66cee4e47cf2cae958850d15a09d1cf0083c1df471f15d250e049ba526dcbc2",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "合伙人大会不得就议程所列以外的事项进行审议，但会议进行中出现需要审议的新情况的除外。但是，合伙人请求将特定事项列入议程的，公司经理应当满足该请求，否则该合伙人有权提请大会裁决。\n每一合伙人均有权讨论列入合伙人大会议程的事项，公司经理有义务回答合伙人的问题；合伙人认为对其问题的答复不充分的，可以提请大会裁决。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "1441cfc5cdc338b5ffd0109d9b6be9e16884cea81d396a7065ce20af771b845b",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 171,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "حقوق الشركاء والتزاماتهم",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "195063d2e08b88cb4a7f1f50189de088d4a9ae92f7851823242aae3b1bc4a8c2",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "cb69dce5dcb3a10cf6169d169682b48bf6cd4bb595ba570e9a646436de9695d8",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "每一合伙人均有权参与审议和表决，其表决权数与其所持出资份额数相等，不得约定与此相反。\n除公司设立合同另有规定外，每一合伙人可以书面委托另一合伙人代其出席合伙人会议并在其中表决。公司设立合同可以规定，合伙人可以书面委托其认为适当的非合伙人代其出席合伙人会议并在其中表决。\n非经理合伙人可以向经理提出意见，并有权（或由其授权之人）在公司会计年度内（两次）请求在公司主要营业地查阅公司业务、查验其记录和文件；公司应当自其请求之日起（十五）日内满足该请求。任何与此相反的条件均属无效。\n任何依据本条获得任何信息之人，均应当保守该信息的机密，不得将其用于任何可能损害公司或其任何合伙人的目的；违反者应当就由此产生的任何损害承担赔偿责任。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "d6c200af07afb1af01f815f6114f4b53249aa29ce895bceb3a73730dfe1a9e3a",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 175,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "توزيع الأرباح على الشركاء",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "796c4645f49ead83499d7e258b5024da647364517dd349b922d3d8fdb757e24a",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "b9be67aa6feaf724ee1ffbaa2d3a3f99e90daada6456d50342b5be73cdbc85eb",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "除公司设立合同另有规定外，各出资份额就净利润和清算盈余享有平等权利。\n合伙人大会确定扣除储备金（如有）后应当向合伙人分配的净利润比例。\n合伙人依照合伙人大会或合伙人就此作出的决议，享有其利润份额；该决议载明应享日期和分配日期。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "30772ed2e2f950b9043009edeef306da9a1fb19cb74ede9336db303cbf9ae288",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 177,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "تكوين الاحتياطيات",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "8a80a933a823d9f1bd3335cf1b1f8878b81011c5395425db732e060462469bed",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "5b9e04a15253f943a0982b4fa07439153ba5ab482925a09c20dc87640d697efb",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "公司设立合同可以规定从净利润中提留一定比例，以设立用于设立合同所定用途的储备金。\n合伙人在合伙人大会年度会议上确定出资份额于净利润中的份额时，可以决定设立储备金，其数额以实现公司利益、或尽可能确保向合伙人分配固定利润为限。该大会亦可以从净利润中提取款项，用于实现有利于公司员工的社会目的。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "11d3953ead6485558003b9024913e38abf40c0f5932fe0eecef25c7036aaa651",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 179,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "إصدار أدوات الدين والصكوك التمويلية",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "2ee4ba0c47955a72e9cb59ae45b6bfe1197e91c6073435918d804e40e8362450",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "8085162bb89581208b2f893efab8fd300bd0c8903247677ce576899fb1734424",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "有限责任公司可以依照资本市场法，发行可流通的债务工具或融资凭证。\n债务工具或融资凭证应当经合伙人依照修改公司设立合同所定程序同意后发行。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "bb76d30e0586415d7b7506d4ee67a03b60f18ba572c9be91fa4340eeeed2ff5f",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 180,
      "bab": 6,
      "article_title_ar": "شراء الحصص وارتهانها ورهنها",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "e7f48d89fa5627bcd581319c91de57e91cbbef3ceb53b6c479bfc3790ced68da",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "bc1874786d84f3ef44b5761422c6696e1de05412596f6ebdf4d8079eb2a22434",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "公司设立合同有规定的，公司可以购买其自身出资份额或接受其作为质押；公司所购买的出资份额在合伙人大会中无表决权。\n出资份额可以质押；除质押合同另有约定外，质权人可以收取利润。\n实施条例确定执行本条规定所需的规则。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "2cc99991bc76e3be96ac5936832f9dc8b0cd47869844b5b89e4eb9112243d777",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
